OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for 39-acre extension of
OL,4,Abusiness park
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been announced to extend a
OL,7,Fbusiness park in Wolverhampton by 39
OL,8,Facres, with work expected to start at
OL,9,Fthe site in early 2028.
OL,11,FThe i54 South Staffordshire complex,
OL,12,Foff Junction 2 of the M54, could see up
OL,13,Fto four new units on an allocated
OL,14,Femployment site, which will be known as
OL,15,FStoford Park i54.
OL,17,FProperty developers Stoford have
OL,18,Fannounced they are working with Midland
OL,19,FLand Portfolio Limited (MLPL), a
OL,20,Fsubsidiary of Severn Trent, on the
OL,21,F660,000 sq ft manufacturing project.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
